	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nudius tertius Isna mihi reverso<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Über <persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> Reise nach <placeName ref="l234">Isny</placeName> ist sonst nichts bekannt.</note> reddebantur li<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>terę tuę<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nicht erhalten.</note>, clarissime et observande <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quibus non est, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ut iis rerum undique nos prementibus turbinibus respondere possim.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>De actis<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Am 5. November hatte <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> die von <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> herausgegebenen Akten des <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Reichstages zugeschickt; vgl. oben <ref target="file11623">Nr. 1580</ref>, 29-32.</note> non dubito, quin, si diligentissime legisses, hoc ipsum quod <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>plęrique iudicares; sed non divelletur ulla ratione a suo ingenio mundus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Gratias tantas pro nihili rebus cave, ut in posterum agas; nos tibi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>innumeris nominibus devincti sumus et sumus libenter non ignorantes <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>singularem illam tuam et omnibus expositam beneficentissimam humanitatem, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quę vicissim a nemine quicquam expectat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Utinam vero ita ferant aliquando <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nostrę rationes, ut gratificari tibi, quam volumus, possimus!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Quod valetis istic recte, qui ecclesiam Christi administratis, summo gaudio <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>accepimus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Dominus hanc valetudinem perpetuo conservet, ne sit populus ipsius <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>velut oves absque pastore<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 9, 36 par</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quod desultorias apud nos vices agit hic <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>morbus, hoc omnino facit, quod apud multos alios.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Vult nos dominus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>alacriores et vigilantiores reddere hocce tam molesto carni excitatore.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p467">Buceri</persName> literas<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Briefe an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> in <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW II 87-89, <ref target="file10956">Nr. 914</ref>, und 92f, <ref target="file10960">Nr. 918</ref>.</note>, quum redirem, hic reperi, qui eadem fere scribit, quę <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>tu ex literis ad <placeName ref="l28">Basilienses</placeName> datis<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> datus.</note> annotaveras<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> hatte offenbar Nachrichten aus <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName>' Brief vom 12. November (oben <ref target="file11626">Nr. 1583</ref>) an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> weitergeleitet.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hic uno propemodum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tenore affligit nos hoc malum, si numerum respicias; interim autem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>insigniores aliquot, quorum unus esse nobis possit vice multorum milium, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>abripit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Inter quos et optimam nostram vereque ecclesię nostrę fidelissimam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>diaconam, germanam sororem meam <persName ref="p4334">Margaritam</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="7"><persName ref="p4334">Margaretha Blarer</persName> starb am 15. November 1541, vgl. <hi>Pressel</hi> 452; ebd. S. 453-457 findet sich ein Klagelied <persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName>.</note> magno omnium luctu de <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>morte in vitam dominus, vitę autor, suo quidem proprio, sed nostro alienissimo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tempore transtulit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quę res ita subinde animo meo recrudescit, ut <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>impotentissimos hic sentiam cordis<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">cordis <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> mei adfectus omnino veritus, ne quid <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>mali toti urbi nostrę mors illa portendat, id quod multi boni <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>mecum verentur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nam quod ad illam attinet, certissimi sumus non esse <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>mortuam, sed mortem vita felicissima commutasse; tam suaviter enim inter sacra <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>verba extremum spiritum plena in Christum fiducia efflavit, ut non mori, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>sed placidissime obdormire dixisses in domino et animam in manus fidelis <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>conditoris deponere.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nobis vero tantum consolationis et commoditatis <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>periit, ut plusquam dimidium animę nostre<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <persName ref="p19882">Horaz</persName>, Oden, 1. 3, 8.</note> amisisse nos incredibili dolore <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>magis magisque intelligamus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quamquam, ubi ad optimi patris voluntatem <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>omnia revocamus, hic quoque bono animo sumus fore sperantes, ut, quando <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>nunquam illa ad nos est reditura, nos propediem ad ipsam, utinam pari felicitate, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>demigremus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Tui<pb type="edition" next="353"/> omnino amantissima fuit nec pridem ante extremum diem <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>valde illi dolebat, quod non sępius ad te scribendo officium faceret<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Briefe von <persName ref="p4334">Margaretha Blarer</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> sind nicht erhalten.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Tu pro nobis ora, ut iisdem vestigiis ad Christum sequi hanc quamprimum <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>liceat; nihil certe magis nunc in votis est; fiat autem voluntas domini.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><pb type="scan" next="40v."/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Commenda me optimis et venerandis fratribus <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, <persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p8412">Megandro</persName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta totam tuam domum cum omnibus amicis et consuli <persName ref="p2816">Rösti[o]</persName><note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Rand im engen Einband verdeckt.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p2816">Diethelm Röist</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Salutant te nostri omnes, frater<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>.</note> cum utroque <persName ref="p4079">Zviccio</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Johannes und <persName ref="p4082">Konrad Zwick</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Scribit alter de comitiis <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>nonnihil et cęli signis<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Ein entsprechender Brief von Konrad oder <persName ref="p4079">Johannes Zwick</persName> ist nicht bekannt.</note>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Ego plura prorsus nequeo.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Dominus et servator <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>noster Iesus<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e">Iesus <hi>in Versalien.</hi></note> Christus ecclesię suę plusquam afflictis rebus in tempore succurrat <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>nostri misertus!</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">In quo bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l257">Constantię</placeName>, ultima novembris 1541.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Fac sciam, num dialogum <placeName ref="l822">Germanicum</placeName> legeris de polygamia<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Gemeint ist die 1541 erschienene Schrift des <persName ref="p1903">Huldrichus Neobulus</persName> (<persName ref="p1903">Johannes Lening</persName>) "Dialogus [...] ob es [...] recht sei, mehr dann eyn Eeweib zugleich zuhaben" (Marburg: Egenolff), in der <persName ref="p1903">Lening</persName> die Doppelehe <persName ref="p3590">Philipps von Hessen</persName> verteidigte. <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> selbst hatte diese Schrift von <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> erhalten (s. <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW II 93).</note>; mittam <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>enim, si non prius vidisti.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Habes hic plumbo effictam <persName ref="p1365">Grynęi</persName> nostri imaginem satis feliciter <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ad vivum expressam,<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Die in Blei gegossene Medaille mit dem Bildnis von <persName ref="p1365">Simon Grynäus</persName> ist ein Werk <persName ref="p6668">Jakob Stampfers</persName>; s. <bibl source="b711">Zürcher Kunst</bibl> nach der Reformation. Hans Asper und seine Zeit. Katalog der Ausstellung im Helmhaus, Zürich 1981, <ref target="file10260">Nr. 229</ref>.</note> quam auream esse omnino conveniebat; sed formam tu potius quam materiam exosculabere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Praestantis<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>simo ecclesię Christi ministro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, fratri suo modis omnibus observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
